                    "#Use a baby sling or carrier. Baby slings and carriers are safe for newborns and allow you to use your hands while toting the baby. Always read the instructions and check the weight minimum before you use it. Your baby's face should never be covered by the sling or your body. If you can see your baby's face, you should be fine. [[Image:Handle a Newborn Baby Step 5 Version 2.jpg|center]]"
                ],
